  "source": "kaldi",
  "note": "biblia.kapisztran.info, Kaldi-Tarkanyi Hungarian Catholic Bible (Vulgate translation, Kaldi Gyorgy 1626, third revision by Tarkanyi Bela, Eger 1865, 'Az Apostoli Szek jovahagyasaval' -- the Hungarian Catholic Bible until the 1973 translation). robots.txt does not exist at this host (404, served by the GitLab Pages 404 page -- the site is a static GitLab Pages deployment with no robots.txt file at all, so no crawl-delay or disallow is stated by the source; the project's own floor of 2.0s is applied regardless). Site is a frameset: '/' loads tartalom.html (book index) in one frame and the first book's szoveg.html in the other. Each of the 73 canonical books has three sibling pages under /{slug}/: szoveg.html (Word-exported whole-book text, verse-anchored 'name=\"{bb}:{ccc}.{vvv}\"'), jegyzet.html (short per-verse notes, same anchor scheme), and jegyzet2.html (extended verse-by-verse commentary, 'kommentarjai'). Confirmed exhaustively via /sitemap.xml (227 URLs = 73*3 book pages + 8 site pages: tartalom.html, index.html, kaldi.jpg, sitemap.xml, and four cross-book introductions -- prof.html 'Bevezetes a profetakhoz', kprof.html 'Bevezetes a kisebb profetakhoz', ev.html 'Bevezetes az evangeliomokhoz', aplev.html 'Bevezetes az apostolok leveleihez'. kaldi.jpg (cover image) and sitemap.xml itself are not captured as they carry no text. Checked 2026-08-28.",
